### Relation to existing checks

- **`duplicateNavLinkTextCount`** (dom-metrics / `homepage-shell`) — duplicate **labels** across chrome.
- **DET.NAV.DEDUP** — duplicate **destinations** across conflicting **bands** (link graph), which matches the spec’s “Link graph” evidence type.
